dialect protocol
protocol stdio.semio.drawing.diff
version 1
schema stdio.semio.drawing
start body
framing record

# drawing wave: REAL binary diff frame, replacing the old `print_diff().into_bytes()` text-as-binary
# shortcut (`🔺️diff/🦀️.rs`'s old `DiffCodec::encode_diff`). `format u8` + `presence u8`
# (bit0=`canvas`, bit1=`styles`, bit2=`layers`) are two REAL fixed fields; past that, 0-3
# varint-length-prefixed opaque blobs follow (one per present field) — modeled as one opaque
# trailing `payload` chain rather than per-segment `Cond`-guarded fields because a SECOND `if`-guard
# on a field that was itself only conditionally decoded hard-errors `eval_cond`
# (`protocol-cond-cannot-chain`, per the recipe's own gap table). The real Rust `encode_diff`/
# `decode_diff` stays genuinely, fully structured (`write_bytes_lp`/`read_bytes_lp`,
# `store::pack_rt`'s real varint codec) — round-trip tested independently.
header fixed 2
field format u8
field presence u8

chain payload bytes
